sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as /auth/token
    participant S as /devices
    C->>A: POST (Basic admin:…) 
    A-->>C: 200 access_token at-0002 · expires_in 1 · refresh_token
    Note over C,A: … 1.5 s later, mid-script …
    C->>S: GET /devices · Bearer at-0002
    rect rgb(253, 232, 232)
    S-->>C: 401 · WWW-Authenticate: Bearer error="invalid_token", "The access token expired"
    end
    C->>A: POST grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=…
    A-->>C: 200 access_token at-0003 · expires_in 300
    rect rgb(212, 237, 218)
    C->>S: GET /devices · Bearer at-0003 (retry once)
    S-->>C: 200 OK
    end
